  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Adventure_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9bd520138d5494937a241566dc585065, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 7758405632
    m_Localized: Adventure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 723962760781824
    m_Localized: Fortress
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 722616921874432
    m_Localized: Forest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11951381000065024
    m_Localized: Player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11951398993629184
    m_Localized: Nature Slime Nest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11951468048650240
    m_Localized: Water Slime Nest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11951488680431616
    m_Localized: Vine Colony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11951520179654656
    m_Localized: Vine Witch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952116706152448
    m_Localized: "This is the plain closest to the village. It used to be home to
      nothing but weak monsters\u2026 but lately, there have been way too many slimes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952173715132416
    m_Localized: "That mass up ahead\u2026 it doesn\u2019t look like just a group
      of slimes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952177456451584
    m_Localized: "<b>Squish\u2026</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952238559072256
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s strange\u2026 I can sense not just the energy of the
      earth, but damp moisture in the air too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952269424955392
    m_Localized: "These slimes don\u2019t seem to be all the same kind. Be careful."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952288257380352
    m_Localized: "<b>Squish Squish\u2026</b>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952321639845888
    m_Localized: The air grew heavy the moment we stepped into the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952345773871104
    m_Localized: "These plants aren\u2019t normal. They\u2019re twisted, like something
      forced them to grow this way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952364224614400
    m_Localized: '<b>Creeeak</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952395698671616
    m_Localized: "So this is the deepest part of the forest\u2026 the atmosphere
      here feels completely different."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952411360202752
    m_Localized: "Heh\u2026 I didn\u2019t expect you to make it this far."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952452426633216
    m_Localized: "Be careful. This enemy may be nothing like the ones we\u2019ve
      faced so far."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952476497743872
    m_Localized: "I thought you were just some clumsy little adventurer\u2026 but
      it seems I\u2019ll have to deal with you myself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952476497743873
    m_Localized: "Play"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952476497743874
    m_Localized: "More stages coming soon."
  - m_Id: 11952500000000000
    m_Localized: Gate Tower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952541234567890
    m_Localized: Rock Mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952582469135780
    m_Localized: Wall Golem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952623703703670
    m_Localized: Fire Spirit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952664938271560
    m_Localized: The air already feels different past this point. The seed nest
      must be close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952706172839450
    m_Localized: The ground is shaking... that's not a slime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952747407407340
    m_Localized: '<b>Creak...</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952788641975230
    m_Localized: Clear the roots and we might see what's underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952829876543120
    m_Localized: You'd do well not to touch what's beneath this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952871111111010
    m_Localized: Too late for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952912345678900
    m_Localized: You came back... are you here to burn my forest to the ground
      this time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952953580246790
    m_Localized: I'm only here to set this forest right again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11952994814814680
    m_Localized: Then I'll wake the oldest things sleeping here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953036049382570
    m_Localized: We've reached the wall. That tower keeps firing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953077283950460
    m_Localized: '<b>Clank... clank...</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953118518518350
    m_Localized: We'll have to break it from outside its range.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953159753086240
    m_Localized: Two towers this time. There's a mage mixed in with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953200987654130
    m_Localized: Don't underestimate the power of stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953242222222020
    m_Localized: Let's bring them down one at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953283456789910
    m_Localized: '<b>Grrrrr...</b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953324691357800
    m_Localized: So that's the gatekeeper. It's huge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953365925925690
    m_Localized: None... shall pass... this gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953407160493580
    m_Localized: It's hot in here. Feels like the forge is lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953448395061470
    m_Localized: Burn!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953489629629360
    m_Localized: We just need to hold out for 100 seconds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953530864197250
    m_Localized: The witch's vines reach even here. Have they wrapped the whole
      keep?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953572098765140
    m_Localized: This keep already belongs to us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953613333333030
    m_Localized: Then let's tear it out by the root.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953654567900920
    m_Localized: You again? This time my fortress will be your grave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953695802468810
    m_Localized: This fortress, this forest... I'm putting it all back the way
      it was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11953737037036700
    m_Localized: Then let's see this through to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000001
    m_Localized: "Slimes are pouring out of that nest. Break it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000002
    m_Localized: "Squish! Squish!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000003
    m_Localized: "Two nests this time. Mind both lanes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000004
    m_Localized: "You'll pay for that!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000005
    m_Localized: "The colony is too tough. Hold out for 90 seconds!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000006
    m_Localized: "30 seconds left!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000007
    m_Localized: "10 more seconds!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000008
    m_Localized: "Heh... you made it this far?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000009
    m_Localized: "Enough games!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000010
    m_Localized: "Rise, my garden!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000011
    m_Localized: "Something heavy is walking this way..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000012
    m_Localized: "Guardians, protect the nest!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000013
    m_Localized: "Cut the roots and the spring will show itself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000014
    m_Localized: "The spring awakens!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000015
    m_Localized: "So you are the one burning my forest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000016
    m_Localized: "Wake, old one!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000017
    m_Localized: "My nests, rise!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000018
    m_Localized: "This forest is MINE!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000019
    m_Localized: "The gate tower still fires. Stay out of its reach and break it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000020
    m_Localized: "The wall is cracking!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000021
    m_Localized: "Two towers guard the wall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000022
    m_Localized: "The other tower turns toward you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000023
    m_Localized: "The gatekeeper wakes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000024
    m_Localized: "Grrrraaah!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000025
    m_Localized: "Defend the gate!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000026
    m_Localized: "The forge is lit. Survive for 100 seconds!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000027
    m_Localized: "30 seconds left!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000028
    m_Localized: "10 more seconds!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000029
    m_Localized: "Vines hold the keep together. Tear out the roots."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000030
    m_Localized: "Something stirs at the heart of the keep..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000031
    m_Localized: "You again? My fortress will be your grave."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000032
    m_Localized: "Forge spirits, burn them!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000033
    m_Localized: "Stone, rise!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000034
    m_Localized: "No... NO!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000035
    m_Localized: "Destroy the targets {0}/{1}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000036
    m_Localized: "Survive {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000037
    m_Localized: "Gate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000038
    m_Localized: "A gate is hanging open in the air. Things keep crossing over from
      the other side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000039
    m_Localized: "Whatever is holding it open doesn't look like it wants to fight."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000040
    m_Localized: "I don't think it opened the gate by choice. Someone forced it to."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000041
    m_Localized: "Still, as long as it stays open, they'll keep pouring out. Let's
      stop the gate first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000042
    m_Localized: "It's not just one gate. Another is about to open further in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000043
    m_Localized: "When a gate bursts, everything inside rushes out at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000044
    m_Localized: "One gate at a time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000045
    m_Localized: "The gates won't stop. They open faster than I can break them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000046
    m_Localized: "I don't need to break them all. I just have to hold out for 100
      seconds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000047
    m_Localized: "For now, let's stop the gate in front of us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000048
    m_Localized: "A gate is open. Stop whoever is holding it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000049
    m_Localized: "A second gate opens!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000050
    m_Localized: "The gate bursts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000051
    m_Localized: "The gate bursts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000052
    m_Localized: "The gates will not stop. Survive for 100 seconds!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000053
    m_Localized: "Another gate opens!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000054
    m_Localized: "Forty seconds left!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000055
    m_Localized: "The tree is charred like coal. Hellfire glows through every crack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000056
    m_Localized: "It must have been born from the world tree. It was exposed to hellfire
      for too long."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000057
    m_Localized: "It draws power from the open gates. While they stay open, I can't
      hurt it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000058
    m_Localized: "Stop the gates first. Then its shield will fall."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000059
    m_Localized: "Every gate is shut and it is still standing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000060
    m_Localized: "It seems to be holding on with its own strength now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000061
    m_Localized: "The gates might open again once it is half down. We'll stop them
      again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000062
    m_Localized: "This is the last one. Let's see it through."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000063
    m_Localized: "The corrupted spirit draws its power from the gates!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000065
    m_Localized: "The spirit has taken in more fire. Close the gates!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000066
    m_Localized: "The gates open again!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000067
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000068
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000069
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000070
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000071
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11960000000000072
    m_Localized: "A gate closes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
